<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="1JN" style="id">- Gamo project</book>
  <para style="h">1 Yanisa</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 Yanisa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Deeyo qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Dey qaala gish koyrope dizayssa nu nu haythan siydaysane nu ayfera be7idaysa loo7ethi xellidays nu kushera ooyki be7idassa gish hsa7os. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Deyoykka qoncides, nukka nu ayfera beydi markatos. Izas iza aawa achan dizasane nuskka qoncida medhiina deyo gish nu intes Yootos. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Inteskka nunara isipetethi dana mala nuni be7idaysanne siydaysa intes yootos. Nu isipetethayka aawarane iza na Yesus Kiristossarako. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nu ufaysay kumetha gidanamala nu hayssa intes xafosu.</para>
  <para style="s">Poo7on simeretetha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nu izape siydi intes yootiza kiitay Xoossi poo7o iza acahan mulekka dhumay dena gizaysako. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nu dhuman simeretishe izara nuusu isipetethi dees; Nu giiko wordotosu attin tuman dokko. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Gido attin izi poo7on diza mala nukka poo7on simeretiko nu garisan nuus isipetethi dees; iza na Yesuss Kirstosa suthi nuna Nagara wurisofe geshees. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nu nunan nagaray bawaa gikko nurka nuna balethos; Tumaykka nunan deena. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nuni nu nagara paaxiiko izi nu nagara atto ganasinne nu marika7atethafe nuna wursi geshanas izi amanetidadene xiiloko. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nu nagara oothi beyko giikko iza nu woradancha kesosne iza qalayka nunan dena.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta nayto ta intes hayssa xafizay inte nagara oothonta malako gido attin oonikka nagara oothiko Aawa achan nus xabaqay dees. izika xiilloza Yesuss Kirstossako. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Izi nu nagaray atto geetetena mala oge gigisizade. Hesikka nuna xalala gidontta kumetha alame asasara attin nuus xalla gidena. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nu iza azazota polliko nu iza eridaysa hessan amanetos. <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Ta iza erays” Gishe iza azazo polontade gidiko he uray wordo asa attiin tumay he uran dena. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Qase oonikka iza qaala nagiko tumu Xoossa siqqoy he 7uran polletides. Nuni izan dizaysa erizay hessankko. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ta izan days giza uray oonikka Yesuss simeretida mala simeristanas beeses.</para>
  <para style="s">ooratha azazo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ta siqoto! ta intes xahaaththaizaysi kasse intes dizaro intekon gam77ida azazoyo attin hara ooratha azazo gidena. Gam77ida azazoya kasse inte siyda qaalako. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hara bagara ta intes xahaaththaizay dhumay adhi bishin tumu poo7on gish iza achanka inte achan tumu gidida ooratha azazoko. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Poo7on daysi gishe ba isha ixiizadey ha7ikka dhuma gidon dees. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Be isha siqqizadey poo7on dees; he uras dhuphe gidiza mishi denna. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Gido attin ba isha ixxizadey gidiko dhuma gidon dees; dhuman simeretes. Dhumay iza qoqisida gish izi awa biizakkone ba bizaso erena. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ta nayto inte nagaray Yesus kiristoosape denddidayssan atto geetetida gish ta intes xafays. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Aawato! kasse koyrope dizaysa iza inte eriza gish ta intes xafays; Natethato inte iitta uraa Xala7e xoonida gish ta intes xahaaththaays. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Natetha nayto! inte Aawa erida gish ta intes xafays. Aawato! koyrope dizaysa iza inte erida gish ta intes xafays. Natethato! inte miinota gidida gishinne Xoossa qaalay intenan diza gish inte iitta ura Xala7e xoonida gish ta intes xafays.</para>
  <para style="s">Alame dossopite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Haysa alameza woykko ha alamezan diza ay mishekka dosopite; Oonika ha alameza dosiiko Aawa siqoy izade achchan deena. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Gasoykka ha alamezan dizay wuri asho amoteth ayfes loo7one dusan ceqeteth hayti alamepe attin Xoossa Aawape yizayta gidetenna. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Alameynne alamen diza amotethi adhana shin Xoossa shene pollizayti gidikko medhinaas daana.</para>
  <para style="s">Kirstossara eqetizaytape nageteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nayto haysi wurisetha sate. Inte siyda mala Kirstosa eqetizadey yaana. Ha7ikka Kirstosara eqetiza daroti yida. Haysi wurisetha sate gididaysa nu hayssan eros. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Isti nu gidofe kezida. Gido attin isti kasseka bagga gidettena. Istti nu bagga gididakko nunara miinni eqqanakoshin; Gido attin istti wuri nu bagga gidontaysi eretana mala nuupe shaaketida <verse number="20" style="v"/>Intena qasse Kirstossay xiillo ayanan tiyides; Hessa gish inte wurikka tuma ereista. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ta intes xafizay inte tuma eronta gish gidena. Gido attin inte tuma eriza gishinne tuma garisafe ayko wordoyka betonttaysa inte eriza gishasa. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesussa izi Kirstossa gidena gi kadizadefe hara wordanchay oone? He uray Aawanne naaza kadiiza Kirstossara eqetizadeko. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Naaza kadizades oonasika Aaway deena; Naaza ekizades wurisos izas Aawayka dees. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Inte koyro siyda qalaya intenan du; inte koyro siydara intenan diko intekka nazanne aawan daana. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Medhina deyoyi izi nuus immana gida ufaysa qaalako. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Intena balethiza asata gish hayssa intes xafadis. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Inte qase izape ekida xiillo ayanay intenan diza gish haray oonikka intena tamarisanas bessena. Izi intena tamarisanays tumu attin worido gidena; Hessa gish xiillo ayanay intena tamarisida mala kirstoosana deyite. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hesa gish nayto izi qonciza wode nusu xalatethi danamala izi yiza wodeka nu iza sinthan yeletonta mala inte izan deyte. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Izi xiillo gididaysa inte eriza gidiko xiillo oothizay wuri izape yelletidaysa inte ereta.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Xoossa nayta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nuni Xoossa nayta getistana mala aaway darisi siqqida iza siqqoy nus aymla giitakko ane beyitte! Tumukka nu iza naytako. Alamey nuna eronta agiday iza eronta agida gishiko. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ta ishato nuni ha7i Xoossa naytako buro nu ay hananakone haii qonccibeyna Kirstosa qoncciza wode nu iza beyanane nuka iza milatanaysa nu eros. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Haysa izan ufaysa oothizay wuri izi gesh gidida mala bena geshes. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nagara oothzay wurikka makal7a nagarayka makal7ako. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Izi nagara dhaysanas qonccidaysa inte ereta. Izanka nagaray ba. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Izan diza uray oonikka nagara oothena. Nagara oothiza uray oonikka gidko iza beyibeyana woykko eribeyna. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ta nayto Intena oonikka balethontamala nagetite. Izi xiillo gidida mala xiilo oothizadeyka xiilokko. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nagara oothizay xala7epeko gasoyka xala7ey koyropeka nagara oothizadeko. Xoossa nay qoncidayka xala7e ootho lalanasa. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Xoossafe yelettiday wurii nagara oothena. Xoossa zerethi izan diza gishine izi Xoossafe yelettida gish nagara oothana danda7ena. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Xoossa naytinne xala7e nayti shaketi eretizay hessankko. Xillo oothontayinne ba isha siqqontay wuri Xoossafe gidena.</para>
  <para style="s">Inte isay isara siqetite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Inte koyro siydara nu nu garisan siiqistana beses getetida kiitaya hanoko. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Iita baga gididi ba isha isethi wodhiida Qayele mala gidopite. izi aazas wodhiide? Gasoykka iza oothoy ita isha oothoy loo7o gididasa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ta ishato intena 7lame 7assay ixiko malaletopite. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nuni nu ishata dosiza gish hayqope gede deyon piinidaysa nu eros. Siqoy baynda uray wuri hayqo garsan dees. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Be isha ixiza uray shempo wodhida asa. Shempo wodhidades medhina deyoy bayndaysa inte ereta. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesuss Kirstosay ba shempo nu gish aathi imida gish siqqoy azakone nu hessan eros. Nukka nu shempo nu ishata gish aathi imanas nus beses. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mishey diza uray oonikka ba ishay wayetishin beydi izas michetonta agiko Xoossa siiqqoy izan wani danee? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ta nayto tumu oothonippe attiin co dunaninne qalan xala siiqeteth ane agos. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nunii tumu baga gididaysa hayssan erosinne nu woznaka iza sinththan shempsos. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hesikka nu woznay nu bolla pirdiza mishan wurisonkko. Xoossi nu wozina qofape bolara gidida gisha izi wursi eres. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ta ishato nu wozzinay nu bolla pirdonta agikko nus Xoossa sinthan babiza mishi deena. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nu azazota nagiza gishine iza ufaysizazi oothiza gish nu iza wosizaz wursi nu izape ekana. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Iza azazoykka nu iza naza Yesus Kirstosa amananasinne izi nuna azazidamala nuni nu garsan dosistana malako. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Iza azazota nagizayti wurii izan detes, izikka istan des. Izi nunan dizaysa nu izi nus imida ayanan eros.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ayana paci xeelite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta ishato ayana wursi amanopite. Gido attiin ayanati Xoossapekonne pacci beyte. Gasoykka daro wordo nabeti biitta bolla laletida. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Inte Xoossa ayana erana ogey; “Yesuss Kirstossay asa asho maydi yides” giza ayanay wuri Xoossafeko. <verse number="3" style="v"/>“Yesuss Kirstosay asa asho mayidi yides” gonta ayanay Xoossafe gidena. Kase izi yana gishin inte siyda Kirstossara eqetizaysa ayanay hessakko. Ha7ikka izi alame bolla dees. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ta nayto inte Xoossita. Inte ista Xonidista gasoykka intenan dizay alamen dizaysafe adhees. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Isti alame bagakko, hessa gish isti hasa7izay wuri alampe kezizaysakko. alame asay isti gizaysa siiyes. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nu qasse Xoossa bagakko, Xoosu erizay nu gizaz siyana shin Xoossa baga gidontadey gidiko nu gizaz siyena. Tumma ayananne wordo ayana nu shakki erizay hayssankko.</para>
  <para style="s">Xossa siqqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ta ishato, siqoy Xoossafe gidida gish nu nu garisa ane siqetos. Asa siqqiza asi wuri Xoossafe yelettidanne Xoosu erizadekko. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ase siqonta assi Xoosu erena. Azas giko Xoosi siqoko. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Xossay nu garsan ba siqqo qonccsiday nu iza bagara deyo demanamala ba na isneza ha dugge ha alamezan yedidaysankko. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nuni Xoossu siqqibeykko shin izi nuna siqides. Nu nagara dhaysana mala ba naza yeddides. Siqo gusikka hessakko. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ta ishato, Xoosi nuna hayssatho siqqiko nukka nu garsan siqistanas beses. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Xoosu be7ida uray oonikka deena. Nu nu garsan siqetiza gidiko Xoosi nunan dana. Iza siqoyka nuna pollistana. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Izi nus ba ayana imida gish nu izan dizaysanne izikka nunan dizaysa nu hessan eros. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Away ba naza hayssa ha alame asa ashanas yedidaysa nu beydosinne iza giish maarkatos. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesussay Xoossa na gididaysa amanidi marikatiza wurson Xoossi deesinne, izadeykka Xoossan dees. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hesa gish, Xoossi nuna siqiza siqo nu eros. Nu iza siqqon amanetos. Xossi siqqo. Siqon diza uray Xoossan dees. Xoosikka he uran dees. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nuni hayssa biitta bolla deyzay Kirstosay deydamala gidida gish nuus piirda galas baboy deena. Hesankka siqqoy nunan kumeth gides. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Siiqo garsan baboy ba, tumu siqqoy gidiko babo kesi wora yeges. Baboy qixxatera isfe ooyketi des. Babiza ura siqqoy kumeth gidena. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Izi kassetidi nuna siqqda gish nukka iza siiqos. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Oonikka Xoosu siqays giishe ba isha ixxiko he uray wordo. Be ayfera beyza ba isha siqonta uray ba ayfen beyonta Xoossa siqanas danda7ena. <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Xoossu siqiza assi wurikka ba isha siqanas beses” Giiza ha azazoza izi nuus imides.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Xoossa nan amano.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesussay izi Kirstossa gididaysa amanizay wuri Xoossafe yelettidas. Aawa dosizay wuri nazaka izatho doses. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nuni Xoosu dosikone iza azazo nagiko nu Xoossa nayta siqizaysa hessan eros. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Xoosu doso gusi iza azazo nagoko. Iza azazoti dexxo gidetena. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Gasoykka Xoossafe yelettiday wurii alame xones. lame xonizaykka nu amanoko. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesussay Xoossa na gididaysa amanizadefe attiin alame xonizay haray oone? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hathanine suththan yiday hayssa Yesus Kiristosako. Izi hathaninne suththan yides attiin hathan xala yibeyna. Hessakka iza gish markatizay ayanakko. He ayanay tumu ayanako. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessa gish izas heedzdzu markati dettes. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Heytika; ayana, hathenne suththukko. Heedzdzata qalayka isinoko. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nu asa marikatet ammanikko Xoossa markatethi hessafe adhees. Hesikka izi ba naza gish immida Xoossa markatethakko. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Xoossa naan amanizade wurisso wozinan iza gish markay dees. Xoosu amanontay wurikka Xoossi benaza gish immida markatetha amanonta gish iza wordoses. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Iza marikatethaykka Xoossi medhina deyo nus imides, he deyoyka iza nazan dees, gizaysakko. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nazi dizades deyoy dees; Xoossa nay bayndades deyoy baawa.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuushsha qoohaaththaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Intes Xoossa nan amanizaytas medhina deyoy dizaysa inte erana mala ta hayssa intes xahaaththaays. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nu Xoossa sinth shiqqanas nus diza xalatethi hayssakko. Nu ay mishekka iza shene mala wosiko izi nu wossa siiyana. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nu iza wosiza miish izi wursi siyzaysa nu eriza gidiko nu wosida misha wursi ekanaysa nu eros. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Oonikka ba ishay bena hayqqos gathonta nagara oothishin beyikko izas woosso. Xoossikka hayqos gathonta nagara oothidaytas deyo imana. Hayqos gathiza nagaraykka dees. Hayqos gaathiza nagara gish woso giike.</para>
</usx>
